{"prayer":{"id":"np-morning-8","title":"8th Prayer. A Midnight Song to the Most Holy Theotokos. — Morning Prayers (1982)","category":"daily","tags":["morning","Theotokos"],"length":"short","use":"private","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed pp.17–19","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":"8th Prayer. A Midnight Song to the Most Holy Theotokos.","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.17","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"I hymn your Grace, O Lady,","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.17","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"and pray that you grace my mind.","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.17","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"Teach me to walk correctly","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.17","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"on the path of Christ’s commandments.","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.17","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"Strengthen me to watch in song,","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.17","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"dispelling the despair of sleep.","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.17","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"I am bound by fetters of sin,","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.17","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"free me by your prayers, O Bride of God!","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.17","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"Keep me in the night and in the day,","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.17","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"delivering me from warring enemies.","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.17","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"As you bore the life-giving God,","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.17","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"give life to me, who am wounded by passions.","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.17","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"As you bore the unsetting Light,","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.17","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"enlighten my blinded soul.","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.17","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"O wondrous palace of the Master,","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.17","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"make me a home of the divine Spirit.","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.17","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"As you bore the Physician,","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.17","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"heal my soul of its passion-filled years.","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.17","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"I am tossed in the tempest of life:","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.18","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"direct me to the path of repentance.","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.18","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"Deliver me from the eternal flame,","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.18","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"from the evil worm, and from hell.","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.18","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"Make me not a joy for demons,","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.18","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"though I am guilty of many sins.","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.18","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"Make me new, most undefiled one,","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.18","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"for I am aged by senseless sins.","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.18","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"Estrange me from all torments,","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.18","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"and pray for me to the Master of all.","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.18","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"Grant that, with all the saints,","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.18","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"I may inherit the joys of heaven.","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.18","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"Hear, most holy Virgin,","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.18","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"the voice of your useless servant.","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.18","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"Grant me a torrent of tears, most pure one,","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.18","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"to wash the filth of my soul.","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.18","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"The groans of my heart I bring you unceasingly:","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.18","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"open your heart, O Lady!","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.18","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"Accept my prayerful service,","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.18","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"and take it to the compassionate God.","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.18","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"You who are far higher than the angels,","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.18","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"raise me above this world’s confusion.","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.18","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"O light-bearing heavenly cloud,","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.18","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"direct spiritual grace into me.","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.19","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"I raise in praise, all-undefiled one,","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.19","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"hands and lips defiled by sin.","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.19","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"Deliver me from soul-corrupting harm,","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.19","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"praying fervently to Christ,","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.19","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"To Whom glory and worship are due,","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.19","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"},{"kind":"prayer","text":"now and ever and unto ages of ages. Amen.","sourceId":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","locator":"Morning Prayers, printed p.19","evidenceFile":"work/expansion/prayers/evidence/pg34981-chapter-c1.txt"}],"publishedRule":false,"completeUnit":"complete published prayer"},"sources":[{"id":"ps-orthodox-daily-prayers-1982","title":"Orthodox Daily Prayers (1982): published prayers and orders","url":"https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/34981","author":"Orthodox Church; compiler and English translators uncredited in the 1982 edition","work":"Orthodox Daily Prayers","edition":"St. Tikhon’s Seminary Press, South Canaan, Pennsylvania, 1982; Project Gutenberg eBook 34981, 2011 text preserved by GITenberg","translator":"English translators uncredited in this edition; traditional attributions retained as printed","year":1982,"tradition":"Eastern Orthodox (OCA; Russian prayer-book tradition)","type":"Published prayer book","rights":"Public domain in the USA according to Project Gutenberg’s catalogue; selected non-psalm prayer texts","rightsUrl":"https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/34981","rightsNote":"The official Project Gutenberg catalogue and preserved metadata designate this edition public domain in the USA. This does not assert public-domain status worldwide. The introduction identifies its Psalms as RSV-based; those Psalm passages are excluded here. Morning Prayers and Compline are not presented as complete native rules because their Psalm passages were not reproduced. The full 1982 wording and sequence of included prayer units is retained, including historical OCA jurisdictional titles, source rubrics, and liturgical alternatives. This is not the 2019 St. Tikhon’s edition or the user’s Mother of God Church rule.","attribution":"Orthodox Daily Prayers (St. Tikhon’s Seminary Press, 1982). Text prepared by Gerard Arthus, Stephen Hutcheson, and the Online Distributed Proofreading Team; Project Gutenberg eBook 34981. Source and distribution terms: https://www.gutenberg.org/policy/license.html.","localLicensePath":"licenses/project-gutenberg.txt","textVerification":"Quotation/source-text matching recorded: expansion-audit.json"}]}
